  ### 8\. [Paradigm AI](https://www.paradigmai.com/)
  
  ![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67cf28c724fc70867ea9f1a7/69a8ca7b0460b9a7e3bbdabe_paradigm-ai.jpg)
  
