  ### 12\. [Originality AI](https://originality.ai/)
  
  ![Originality AI content detector](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67cf28c724fc70867ea9f1a7/69a8cc9f785bee05415a6e50_originality-ai.jpg)
  
