  **Why this matters:**
  
  Generic AI content screams “This is AI-generated!” Brand-consistent content feels human.
  
  **Best for:** Solo founders, creators, and small teams who can’t afford design/marketing help.
  
  **Note:** You might need a VPN if it’s not available in your country (it’s still rolling out globally).
  
  ## 6\. ChatGPT Atlas & Perplexity Comet: AI Inside Your Browser
  
  **What they do:** Understand and work with whatever webpage you’re on
  
  **What they replace:** Research extensions, summarizers, SEO tools
  
  This is where things got interesting in 2025.
  
  Instead of you going to AI tools, **the AI came to your browser.**
  
  Both ChatGPT Atlas and Perplexity Comet do something powerful: they understand the page you’re already on and help you work with it.
  
