  | Claude | Writing long-form content | Free, $20/month | 9/10 |
  | ChatGPT | Best for writing copies | Free, $20/month | 9.5/10 |
  | Grammarly | AI-assisted writing, grammar check | Free, $12/month | 8/10 |
  | Jasper AI | Multipurpose (content, marketing & App Development) | $49/month/seat (7-day Free Trial) | 8/10 |
  | Canva | Visual content, image generation | Free, $12.99/month | 9/10 |
  | Gemini | Brainstorming content ideas, for fact-checking & image creation | Free | 9/10 |
  | Surfer SEO | SEO-optimized content, content humanizer | $99/month | 9/10 |
  | Frase AI | Content to outrank competitors | $45/month (10K Free AI Words) | 8/10 |
  | Perplexity | Provides Real-time sources beyond traditional search | Free | 8.5/10 |
  | Copy.AI | Copywriting, social media posts, website copy | $29/ month | 8.2/10 |
  
